cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Eigeneyes: A statistical model of whole-eye geometry and its applications"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB code to build a statistical shape model of the whole eye
  (eigeneyes) from ocular biometry surfaces using principal component
  analysis (SVD), and to evaluate it with subject-grouped 10 x 10
  cross-validation.
